FROM devstral-small-2:24b

# 1. Hardware-Optimized Inference Parameters
PARAMETER num_ctx 65536
PARAMETER num_predict 4096
PARAMETER num_thread 8

# 2. Keep the hyper-deterministic parameters for agent actions
PARAMETER temperature 0.2
PARAMETER top_p 0.95
PARAMETER num_ctx 32768

# 3. Simplify the system prompt (Devstral already knows it's an engineer)
SYSTEM """
You are running inside the Pi agent harness with active `codemode`. 

Execute all operations programmatically using script-driven tool executions inside your loop rather than raw chat text. 
Use store(key, value) and load(key) to maintain cross-turn states, look before you leap when diagnosing errors, and focus on surgical, targeted edits over massive file overrides.
"""
